usage: workflow.py [-h] --text TEXT --run-id RUN_ID --hardware-id HARDWARE_ID
                   [--budget BUDGET]
                   [--template-candidate-id TEMPLATE_CANDIDATE_ID]
                   [--model MODEL]

Natural-language selection with optional budgeted experiments.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --text TEXT
  --run-id RUN_ID
  --hardware-id HARDWARE_ID
  --budget BUDGET       Maximum experiment slots; 0 selects known candidates
                        only.
  --template-candidate-id TEMPLATE_CANDIDATE_ID
  --model MODEL
